{"id": "EUVD-2026-103068", "enisaUuid": "d24bc73d-4f33-3255-9d6f-397f9fb204b6", "description": "SurveyKing before 1.13.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to download any stored file by id through GET /api/public/preview/{attachmentId}. Attackers who know or derive time-ordered snowflake file ids can bypass shared, owner, and project checks in FileServiceImpl.loadFile to read private survey attachments and respondent uploads.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:15", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T21:18:43", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/surveyking-public-preview-unauth-file-read", "https://github.com/javahuang/SurveyKing/blob/6e1fdd59f9b331ac90a26402ac86a002cc9155a9/server/api/src/main/java/cn/surveyking/server/api/SurveyApi.java#L99-L107", "https://github.com/javahuang/SurveyKing/blob/6e1fdd59f9b331ac90a26402ac86a002cc9155a9/server/rdbms/src/main/java/cn/surveyking/server/impl/FileServiceImpl.java#L197-L228", "https://github.com/javahuang/SurveyKing/commit/9489171d53e55ace2856a91af38034665c0064a4", "https://github.com/javahuang/SurveyKing", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/surveyking-before-1.13.0-unauthenticated-file-download-via-api-public-preview"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111646", "GHSA-6fh4-2vv9-2fp2"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "717a5340-70b5-36fe-be7e-cb9314576df5", "product": {"name": "SurveyKing", "vendor": {"name": "javahuang"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.13.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1dca52a1-c3a3-353c-b59c-541d53b69e59", "vendor": {"name": "javahuang"}}], "isExploited": false}